On **.NET 10 SDK**, you do **not** need `TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport`. That property is only for .NET 9 and earlier.

Instead, add a `"test"` section to your `global.json`:

```json
{
  "sdk": {
    "version": "10.0.100"
  },
  "test": {
    "runner": "Microsoft.Testing.Platform"
  }
}
```

**Key differences from the .NET 9 approach:**

| .NET 9 (legacy bridge) | .NET 10 (native) |
|---|---|
| `<TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport>true</TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport>` in props | `"test": { "runner": "Microsoft.Testing.Platform" }` in `global.json` |
| Must use `--` to separate MTP args: `dotnet test -- --report-trx` | Args passed directly: `dotnet test --report-trx` |

